    <informations>Shelly 2PM Gen3 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O1 L L O2 S1 S2 N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-2pm-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_d62c6476361fe6244a22e13e9414635b259cc3a2f79e8465082b8bcbb7ca7984/Shelly%202PM%20Gen3_semi%20front%20view.png?cb=4aec46e225f5861e9ca3a594aa2bd50e
